#. (itstool) path: component/name
#: org.kde.plasma.iconexplorer.appdata.xml:8
msgid "Icon Explorer"
msgstr "Preglednik ikona"

#. (itstool) path: component/summary
#: org.kde.plasma.iconexplorer.appdata.xml:9
msgid "Icon Previewer for Artists and Developers"
msgstr "Preglednik ikona za umjetnike i programere"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.plasma.iconexplorer.appdata.xml:11
msgid "Icon Explorer allows artists and developers to preview and pick icons. Icon Explorer attempts to render the icons exactly as they would look drawn in the application. It allows to filter based on category and name. Icon Explorer is not a general-purpose tool, but geared towards artists' and developers' use-cases. Icon Explorer also provides a plugin for Kate and KDevelop to be used as icon picker."
msgstr "Preglednik ikona omogućuje umjetnicima i programerima pregled i odabir ikona. Pokušava prikazati ikone upravo onako kako bi izgledale u aplikaciji. Omogućuje filtriranje prema kategoriji i nazivu. Nije alat opće namjene, već je namijenjen potrebama umjetnika i programera. Preglednik ikona nudi i dodatak za Kate i KDevelop koji služi za odabir ikona."
